        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Aug 29, 2025",
            "id": "6a5329a8-40e4-4f53-9b6b-336bebf6c446",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your review! We’re really happy to hear you and your family had a great time and enjoyed the safe, convenient location of the home.\n\nWe’re sorry to hear about the paper products and ice makers not meeting your expectations. This home has always been well-stocked and has received wonderful feedback, but we completely understand that every group has different needs. If we had known during your stay, we would have been more than happy to bring over additional supplies or take a look at the ice makers right away to make things easier for you.\n\nWe truly appreciate your feedback and will make sure our team double-checks these details going forward. We’d love the chance to host you again in the future!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We had a great time. The location was so convenient and safe. For a large family group we had difficulty finding dining options. The house should be better stocked with paper products and the ice makers didn't work.",
